@startuml
autonumber
actor User
participant "CV Parser" as CVParser
participant "CV Editor" as CVEditor
participant "Screening Question Manager" as ScreeningQuestionManager
participant "Rating Generator" as RatingGenerator
CVParser ->> CVEditor : Parse CV and send data to CV Editor
CVEditor -> ScreeningQuestionManager : Request screening questions from Screening Question Manager
ScreeningQuestionManager ->> RatingGenerator : Send applicant's answers to Rating Generator
CVParser ->> RatingGenerator : Send parsed CV data to Rating Generator
RatingGenerator ->> CVEditor : Send rating result to CV Editor
CVEditor -> Applicant : Display rating result to applicant
@enduml